# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env* is git-ignored — never commit a key.
#
# CARTO basemap key. Optional: without it the map still works, but CARTO
# watermarks the tiles. Get a free one at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey
#
# This value is inlined into the client bundle at build time, as any browser
# map key must be — the visitor's own browser is what calls the tile service.
# Restrict it by domain in the CARTO dashboard rather than treating it as a
# secret.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CARTO_KEY=
